## Final Reusable Prompt

> Write a Python data quality audit function using pandas with the following specification:
> 
> **Goal:** Create a reusable function `audit_missing_values(df: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame` that analyzes missing data.
> **Requirements:**
> 1. Calculate both total missing count and missing percentage per feature.
> 2. Filter out features with 0 missing values.
> 3. Sort results by missing percentage in descending order.
> 4. Format percentages to two decimal places.
> 5. Safely return an empty report schema if input DataFrame is empty.
> 6. Provide standard Python type hints and concise docstrings.
> **Constraints:** Do not import extra visualization libraries; rely strictly on standard pandas operations.
